{"route":"/hop/wiki/perks/tax","title":"Perk Tax - House of Pips Wiki","description":"Perk Tax (Malus) in House of Pips: Each perk bonus loses 1 point.","html":"<p class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks\">Perks</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks#malus\">Malus</a></p>\n<article class=\"entry rarity-malus\" id=\"perk-tax\">\n<header class=\"entry-head\">\n<img class=\"entry-icon\" src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/tax-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\">\n<div><h1>Perk Tax</h1><p class=\"entry-sub\">Malus &middot; Scoring penalty</p></div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"entry-body\">\n<div class=\"entry-main\">\n<blockquote class=\"card-text\"><p>Each perk bonus loses 1 point.</p><footer>In-game card text</footer></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"how-it-works\">How it works</h2>\n<p><strong>Malus.</strong> Every bonus on a scoring play <strong>costs 1 point for each copy of Perk Tax</strong>.</p>\n<ul><li>Each bonus line on the play counts once, including multiplier lines such as <a class=\"ref rarity-legendary\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/midas\" title=\"Legendary perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/midas-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Midas Touch</a>, <a class=\"ref rarity-epic\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/golden_double\" title=\"Epic perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/golden_double-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Golden Double</a> and <a class=\"ref rarity-legendary\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/equalizer\" title=\"Legendary perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/equalizer-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">The Equalizer</a>.</li><li>Perk Tax can never take a play below its open-end total, and it never adds points. A play with no bonuses is not taxed.</li><li><a class=\"ref rarity-uncommon\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/shield\" title=\"Uncommon perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/shield-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Pip Shield</a> can give the points back, and <a class=\"ref ref-skill\" href=\"/hop/wiki/skills#malus_ward\" title=\"Skill tree: House Rules\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/skills/malus_ward-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Malus Ward</a> can block it.</li></ul>\n<aside class=\"callout callout-example\"><p class=\"callout-title\">Worked example</p><p>Ends total 10 with <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/doubles\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/doubles-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Double Trouble</a> and <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/even_flow\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/even_flow-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Even Flow</a>: 10 + 10 = 20. Two bonus lines and one copy of Perk Tax: the play scores <strong>18</strong>.</p></aside>\n<h2 id=\"at-a-glance\">At a glance</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"facts\"><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Rarity</th><td><span class=\"pill rarity-malus\">Malus</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Type</th><td>Scoring penalty</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">How to get it</th><td>Never bought. A Malus card is dealt into every standard draft.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"entry-card\"><a href=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/tax-card.png\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/tax-card.png\" alt=\"The Perk Tax card as drawn in the game\" width=\"468\" height=\"498\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>The card as it appears in a draft.</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</article>\n<nav class=\"pager\" aria-label=\"Neighbouring perks\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/jinx\">&larr; Five Jinx</a><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/exposed\">Exposed Hand &rarr;</a></nav>","toc":[]}